    "title": "Large structure fire reported at Woodson Bend Resort - NewsBreak",
    "text": "BRONSTON, Ky. ( FOX 56 ) — Pulaski County firefighters responded Wednesday to a large structure fire in Bronston. Bystanders told FOX 56 News the fire was near the 900 block of Colyer Road at Woodson Bend Resort. As of 10 p.m., fire crews were still at the scene, with the structure appearing to be a total loss. FOX 56 News has reached out to Pulaski County officials to learn more, but hasn’t heard back. A cause for the fire has not been announced. This is a developing story. Stay with FOX 56 News for updates. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to FOX 56 News.",
